debug.keystore
# ...except the repo-pinned shared debug key: without it every CI runner
# generated a fresh ephemeral key, so each CI-built APK had a different
# signing certificate and Android demanded an uninstall (full app-data wipe)
# before Installing the next build. The pinned key keeps debug-APK updates
# install-in-place. It only signs debug builds; release signing uses the
# upload key from KEYSTORE_PATH/my-upload-key.jks (never committed).
!/debug.keystore
codec-packages/.work
codec-packages/dist
__pycache__/
*.pyc
